# Build-context hygiene.
#
# The repo directory is ~6.6 GB. The FE/BE images are built from this root
# context (so `npm ci` can see package-lock.json), which means everything not
# listed here gets tarred into the context and, where COPY . applies, into the
# image. The backend image previously carried be/data (2.3 GB of rendered
# videos) because nothing excluded it.

# --- dependencies / build output: always regenerated in-image ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- huge, and not read by the server at runtime ---
# be/data/bible is NOT excluded: bibleService.js reads it at runtime.
be/data/scripture-video
subtitles_corpus
Waggoner_verses
allthepreaching_old
screenshots
fts/target

# --- VCS / editor ---
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.swp

# --- secrets and local config: injected via build args / env instead ---
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.local
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# --- logs, artifacts, docs ---
*.log
**/*.log
*.tar
*.mp4
*.mkv
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore

# --- k8s manifests / markdown are not needed in the image ---
k8s
*.md
